  "notes": "## 1.0.0-alpha.3 - 2026-08-06\n\n### Features\n\n- Automatically send the latest clipboard item missed by each existing device when it comes back online (#1517)\n- Show connection recovery progress on the Devices page and offer a retry when automatic recovery cannot restore the connection (#1518)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Ensure canceling an incoming file transfer finishes cleanly and removes its temporary history entry (#1517)\n- Ensure removing a permanently lost device finishes correctly when it has already been removed or the shared security state cannot be recovered (#1520)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.0.0-alpha.3 - 2026-08-06\n\n### Features\n\n- 已有设备重新上线后，自动补送该设备错过的最新一条剪贴板内容 (#1517)\n- 在设备页面显示连接恢复进度，并在自动恢复失败时提供重试操作 (#1518)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 确保取消正在接收的文件后传输能正常结束，并移除对应的临时历史记录 (#1517)\n- 确保永久丢失设备已被移除或共享安全状态无法恢复时，设备移除流程能正确结束 (#1520)",
